{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And if you refuse to send, here I am killing your firstborn son.</b> Measure for measure. Here Rashi commented: this is the last plague, etc. And this is what is said in Job, etc. — thus is our reading. And we do not read 'and this is what Job said,' for Job did not say it, but Elihu did."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "Chizkuni quotes Rashi's text and then notes a variant: some read 'this is what Job said,' but the correct reading is 'this is what is said in Job,' since the statement is Elihu's, not Job's own words."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:09.776193232Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}